    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "The Hilton Young Commission (Royal Commission on Indian Currency and Finance) recommended the establishment of the Reserve Bank of India.",
        "14 major commercial banks were nationalised on July 19, 1969, and 6 more banks were nationalised in 1980.",
        "Cash Reserve Ratio (CRR) reserves are held with the RBI in cash form, whereas Statutory Liquidity Ratio (SLR) reserves are held with the bank itself in liquid assets."
      ],
